Then publish each milestone separately on LinkedIn. By the end, you will have:

- A real-world cloud project.
- A GitHub portfolio.
- Multiple practical LinkedIn posts.
- A project you can explain during interviews.

## 7. Improve your LinkedIn profile headline

Your headline should reflect both your current experience and your learning direction. Suggested version:

> Senior .NET Developer | 9+ Years of Software Development Experience | Learning AWS Cloud & DevOps | ASP.NET Core | C# | Microservices | Docker | CI/CD

Don't claim AWS DevOps Engineer experience until you have actually gained professional experience in that role. Showing your learning journey honestly is a strength.

