## 9. Start a "100 Days of AWS Cloud" series

You don't have to post 100 days consecutively. You can share practicals 3 times per week. Use a consistent naming style:

- AWS Practical #01 – Creating IAM Users and Roles
- AWS Practical #02 – Launching EC2 Instance
- AWS Practical #03 – Connecting Linux EC2 using SSH
- AWS Practical #04 – Deploying ASP.NET Core API
- AWS Practical #05 – Uploading Files to S3 using C#
- AWS Practical #06 – Connecting AWS RDS with Entity Framework Core

This creates a recognizable learning series on your LinkedIn profile.

